note "Guide level 5's swelling dock for the site at scale 1.5: six pinned apps settled in the warmup; the pointer runs along the dock in 600 ms and off it, each icon growing by its distance from the pointer (up to 1.4x) and shrinking back; checked frame by frame in light and dark"
